---
description: Single donor for course chrome CSS/JS
alwaysApply: false
globs:
  - "**/уроки/**"
  - "**/*-polish/**"
---

For offline course UI chrome (`course-ui.css`, `course-nav.css`/`js`, `course-video.js`, `course-seen.js`):

- Copy only from `уроки/_course-chrome-kit/` (or the workspace-equivalent kit path).
- Never copy `_assets` from another finished course and “tweak” it.
- Build per-course `course-nav.json` from scratch for that course.
